sp500_ticker_start_end.csv is vendored verbatim from the fja05680/sp500
project (https://github.com/fja05680/sp500), snapshot of 2026-06-08.

It is the point-in-time S&P 500 membership baseline: one row per spell, with
the dates a ticker entered and left the index, reaching back to the 1990s.
Wikipedia only publishes today's constituents, so a fresh install has no way to
reconstruct this history on its own -- see quantmine/workflows/universe.py.

